Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeUrbanIntersectionWithTraffic" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3, :risk4 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow taxi vehicle ahead" .
:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black vehicle in front of ego vehicle" .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Wet road surface" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Nighttime with low visibility" .

:trafficLight1 a :TrafficLight ;
    :description "Red traffic light ahead" .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision due to following distance and braking" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Occlusion risk due to nighttime and limited visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of skidding or hydroplaning due to wet road surface" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:risk4 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "General collision risk due to traffic light intersection" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev4 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:sev4 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.70"^^xsd:float .
```

